OL,3,ACharity tea room may close despite
OL,4,ALudwig filming
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tea room being used to film the third
OL,7,Fseries of Ludwig starring David
OL,8,FMitchell could close permanently unless
OL,9,Fit raises #25,000.
OL,11,FTrustees of the volunteer-run Liberty
OL,12,FTea Rooms and Community Hub in Hemel
OL,13,FHempstead, Hertfordshire, said the
OL,14,Fcharity was in an "extremely low cash
OL,15,Fposition".
OL,17,FMark Kitson, chairman of the trustees,
OL,18,Fsaid the series being filmed at the
OL,19,Fvenue had created a real buzz and it
OL,20,Fhad been good to hire it out "at a time
OL,21,Fthat we really need the extra funds".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
